    "title": "あのね",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/10292177.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20160907191353/http://lineblog.me/kano/archives/10292177.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "e3e55ecce05b.jpg",
            "source": "http://line.blogimg.jp/kano/imgs/e/7/e7a496b5.jpg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "そろそろ夏から秋！ということで、ベッド周りから今日は模様替えをはじめてみました。夏の間は青系多めのお部屋だったのですが、今日からは赤系多めに生まれ変わりました。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "差不多该从夏天进入秋天了！所以今天先从床铺周围开始试着重新布置了一下。整个夏天房间都以蓝色系为主，但从今天起它焕然一新，变成以红色系为主了。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It's almost time to go from summer to autumn! So today I started redecorating, beginning with the area around my bed. My room was mostly blue over the summer, but from today it's been reborn with mostly red."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなはそろそろ秋だし、◯◯をチェンジするか〜〜みたいなのありますか？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家呢，秋天快到了，有没有“要不要把某某换一换〜〜”之类的想法呀？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Is there anything you all change around now that autumn is near, like \"time to swap out XX\"?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "よかったらみんなのことを鹿乃に教えてくださいφ(｡_｡*)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "方便的话，把大家的事也讲给鹿乃听听吧φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Please tell Kano about yourselves φ(｡_｡*)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ちなみになのですが、ブログを書くときは何かしら写真を載せたいなと思っている鹿乃なのですが、特にこれといって写真がなかったのでベッドの中から撮れる身近なものを撮ってみました笑"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "顺带一提，鹿乃我写博客的时候总想放点照片上去，不过这次没什么特别想拍的照片，就从被窝里伸手拍了些手边的小物件，哈哈。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "By the way, whenever I write a blog I want to include some kind of photo, but I didn't really have any in particular, so I took something familiar that I could shoot from inside my bed lol"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さて来週はいよいよ鹿乃3rdシングル「nameless」のリリース週！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "那么下周终于就是鹿乃第三张单曲《nameless》发售的那一周了！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now then, next week is finally release week for Kano's 3rd single \"nameless\"!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "nameless",
            "source": "http://ecx.images-amazon.com/images/I/51c%2B7U1ICBL._SL160_.jpg",
